-- ---- s 543: Numbering of shares --------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- src:7579 | (2) If at any time—
-- src:7580 | (a) all the issued shares in a company are fully paid up and rank pari passu for all purposes, or
-- src:7581 | (b) all the issued shares of a particular class in a company are fully paid up and rank pari passu for all purposes,
-- src:7582 | none of those shares need thereafter have a distinguishing number so long as it remains fully paid up and ranks pari passu for all purposes with all shares of the same class for the time being issued and fully paid up.
@ref s 543(2) no distinguishing number needed where all shares are fully paid up and rank pari passu (src:7579-7582)
GIVEN `all the issued shares in the company are fully paid up and rank pari passu for all purposes` IS A BOOLEAN
      `all the issued shares of the particular class in the company are fully paid up and rank pari passu for all purposes` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the share remains fully paid up and ranks pari passu for all purposes with all shares of the same class for the time being issued and fully paid up` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 543(2) the share need not have a distinguishing number` MEANS
    IF     (    `all the issued shares in the company are fully paid up and rank pari passu for all purposes`
            OR  `all the issued shares of the particular class in the company are fully paid up and rank pari passu for all purposes`)
       AND `the share remains fully paid up and ranks pari passu for all purposes with all shares of the same class for the time being issued and fully paid up`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "If at any time— (a) ... or (b) ..." and "so long as it remains fully paid up and ranks pari passu" (an "if" and a "so long as" that fail: marginal reading (a))

